terse 0.1
project groups "Groups and nesting"

# a group takes no schedule: its dates come from its children
build "Build" group
  frame "Frame" task 2026-10-05..2026-10-16
  fit-out "Fit-out" group
    wiring "Wiring" task 5d after frame
    panels "Panels" task 1w after frame +2d
  inspect "Inspection" gate 2026-11-02 after fit-out
handover "Handover" gate 2026-11-20 after build.end +3d, inspect
